Wednesday, halfway through the trading week, welcome to Modern Investing Techniques, Episode

00:00:04.360 --> 00:00:13.080
114. It's July 22nd, 2026, and I'm Patrick in Vancouver. Midweek, let's reassess this week's

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:19.220
positions and look for fresh setups. Quick reminder, everything we discuss here is for education and

00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:24.680
