Canadian TFSA users can layer this data onto sector ETF screens on wealth simple or quest trade

00:04:10.580 --> 00:04:16.640
to identify rotation candidates earlier than headline reports. Access comes via enterprise

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:22.700
subscription or through partnered research portals. The Vios open source networking platform

00:04:22.700 --> 00:04:31.180
